      "claim_text": "<span id=\"thm:reconstruction\" label=\"thm:reconstruction\">\\[thm:reconstruction\\]</span> The joint sequences \\[(O_{\\K}(m))_{m\\geq1},\\qquad (N_{\\K}(n))_{n\\geq1}\\] determine \\(|\\K|\\) and every multiplicity \\(c_d^+,c_d^-,c_d^0\\). Equivalently, they determine the multiset \\(\\{(d_\\chi,\\nu_\\chi):\\chi\\in\\Irr(\\K)\\}\\).",
