      "claim_text": "If \\(r\\) distinct degrees occur, the known-base clause of [\\[lem:finite-moments\\]](#lem:finite-moments), now with \\(m_0=0\\), shows that \\(R_0,\\ldots,R_{r-1}\\) recover the coefficients \\[b_d:=\\frac{c_d^+-c_d^-}{d}.\\] Since each degree \\(d\\) is already known from [\\[eq:P-moments\\]](#eq:P-moments), multiplying by \\(d\\) gives \\(\\delta_d:=d b_d=c_d^+-c_d^-\\) for every degree.",
